  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_DROPPING_WILDS
    value: '<size=24>- Dropping Wilds feature is randomly triggered during reel spin.

      - A random number of Wilds will be added to reels 2, 3, or 4.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FORTUNE_COINS_JACKPOT
    value: <style=title><size=42>FORTUNE COINS JACKPOT</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FORTUNE_COINS_JACKPOT
    value: "<size=24>- Each Wild appearing on reels (not from Dropping Wild feature).\n
      \ has probability of triggering the Fortune Coins Jackpot.\n- Upon Fortune Coins
      Jackpot trigger, a Fortune Coins Picker will appear.\n- Select 3 of the same
      Jackpot symbols to be awarded Jackpot."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatter symbols in any position triggers Free Games.\n-
      User can select between 2 Free Games options.\n   - Free Game Type 1: Royals
      are removed from the reels.\n   - Free Game Type 2: All way wins are multiplied
      by 3.\n- 3 or more Scatters during Free Games will award additional free games."
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>243 WAYS</color></size>
